{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>כי הגדילו</b> — a noun or a participle (standing [verb])." "And the meaning of <b>פן ישמחו לי</b> — like <b>פן יאמרו לי</b>, for behold, when my foot slips and I am sick, they magnified against me."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:30:10.573767967Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}